    thinking: "**Defining Map Styles**\n\nOkay, I\'m starting to build out the `mapStyles.ts` file now. My focus is on sourcing the map style URLs. I\'m checking for the `VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL` environment variable first, then considering `VITE_MAP_` variables as an alternative.\n\n\n**Incorporating Dark Mode**\n\nI\'ve got the dark mode implementation underway, and it is progressing well. I\'m focusing on providing dark style URLs, starting with MapTiler integration, then using a CartoDB fallback. I\'ve also incorporated a built-in fallback MapLibre style specification for offline or testing environments. Next up, I\'ll be defining color tokens for different threat levels and visual elements, such as arcs and clusters.\n\n\n"
